By the time they enter Gehennom, most player's natural healing rate is
larger than what regeneration gives. Magic cancellation protects quite
effectively against level drain. I personally don't think the Staff is
a worthwhile weapon.

But if you insist on wielding the staff, you might want to scatter a
few potions of holy water (on Elbereth) in places you can reach
quickly. You cannot #pray, reach in your bag, or cast spells to
uncurse it, but you can pick up holy water and #dip it.


